{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ea947292-78e9-8d0c-8041-a07494bf2cb2",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T11:11:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. My name is Barbara Chase. I'm calling for my mother. We're doing a renovation at her house and we need a dumpster out on the street. Do we need a permit for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's sitting on the street and not in the driveway, yes, you'll generally need a permit. Is it going on a city street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. On the street, in front of the house. It's four, two, five Van Zandt Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 425 Van Zandt, North End. Got it. Is the work itself already permitted, or is it just the dumpster you're asking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the dumpster right now. The, um, the building part we're still sorting out. The dumpster is what we need first, for the demolition."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. You'd fill out the street occupancy application for the dumpster. I can point you to the form, or you can come by the office and pick one up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask how long approval takes? Because the company wants to drop it off soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few business days once we have a complete application. Don't schedule the delivery until you've got the approval in hand. With the storm just ending today, things may run a little slower this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:10:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few business days. Okay. That's fine. I just have to plan around work. My shift at the distribution center got moved again, so I can't always get here during the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. You can submit it by email or drop it off, whichever's easier. If you've got questions on the form, call back and ask for me or anyone at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:10:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Could you, um, send me the form? Or tell me where it is on the website?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on the city website under Zoning and Inspections, in the forms section. Look for the street occupancy or dumpster permit. Do you want me to hold while you write that down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:10:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's okay. I'll find it. Zoning and Inspections, forms. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:11:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:11:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T11:11:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
